<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>결제 상세 내역</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
<body><#include "/fragments/header.ftl"><main class="narrow payment-detail-page"><section class="panel payment-detail-panel">
<p class="eyebrow">Payment Detail</p><div class="payment-detail-head"><div><h1>결제 상세 내역</h1><p>${temporals.format(order.paidAt, 'yyyy년 MM월 dd일 HH:mm')}</p></div><span class="payment-status">결제 완료</span></div>
<div class="payment-product"><span>${order.procedureProduct.category}</span><strong>${order.procedureProduct.name}</strong><small>${order.procedureProduct.summary}</small></div>
<dl class="summary-list payment-detail-summary"><div><dt>주문번호</dt><dd>${order.orderNumber}</dd></div><div><dt>예약 날짜</dt><dd><#if order.reservationDate??>${temporals.format(order.reservationDate, 'yyyy년 MM월 dd일')}<#else>미지정</#if></dd></div><div><dt>결제수단</dt><dd><#if order.method == 'CARD'>신용카드<#elseif order.method == 'BANK_TRANSFER'>무통장입금<#elseif order.method == 'KAKAO_PAY'>간편결제<#else>${order.method}</#if></dd></div><div><dt>상품 금액</dt><dd>${numbers.formatInteger(order.originalAmount)}원</dd></div><div><dt>쿠폰 할인</dt><dd>-${numbers.formatInteger(order.couponDiscount)}원</dd></div><div><dt>포인트 사용</dt><dd>-${numbers.formatInteger(order.pointsUsed)}P</dd></div><div class="payment-total-row"><dt>최종 결제 금액</dt><dd>${numbers.formatInteger(order.amount)}원</dd></div><div><dt>적립 포인트</dt><dd>${numbers.formatInteger(order.earnedPoints)}P</dd></div></dl>
<div class="actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="/mypage?userId=${currentUserId}">마이페이지로</a><a class="button" href="/procedures">다른 프로그램 보기</a></div>
</section></main><#include "/fragments/footer.ftl"></body></html>
